    "sub_name": "行為量化與分析",
    "sub_ename": "QUANTIFICATION AND ANALYSIS OF BEHAVIOR",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹投資人和消費者的行為模式，藉由量化工具建立相關的指標。我們將以實際的市場資料做為測試，分析資料以提升預測的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces behavioral patterns of investors and consumers, and tries to build the relevant indices through quantitative methods. We will use the real market data to test our viewpoints and analyze the data to increase the forecasting ability.",
